PROJECT NAME: CREATORBOOST

Social Media Services, Digital Products, Coins & Rewards Platform

Act as a world-class UI/UX designer, senior Android application developer, frontend engineer, backend architect, database engineer, and product designer.

Build a complete, professional, premium-quality mobile application named CREATORBOOST.

The application should be inspired by the uploaded reference screenshots.

IMPORTANT:
Use the uploaded screenshots as the primary design reference for the application layout, navigation, wallet, services, categories, coin system, mascot, leaderboard, and account screens.

However, improve the design significantly with more features, better user experience, modern interactions, and professional UI.

Do not simply copy the screenshots. Create a more polished, premium, modern product.

==================================================

1. APPLICATION CONCEPT
   ==================================================

CreatorBoost is a coin-based social media creator tools and digital services marketplace.

Users can:

- Explore different service categories.
- Purchase digital content packs.
- Unlock hashtags.
- Get captions and content ideas.
- Generate social media bios.
- Access creative tools.
- Purchase coins.
- Earn reward points.
- Collect daily rewards.
- Participate in leaderboards.
- Complete promotional missions.
- Refer friends.
- Track their orders.
- Manage transactions.
- Upgrade their user levels.

The application must support multiple languages and be suitable for an international audience.

Primary currency: INR (₹).

Virtual currency: Coins.

Reward currency: Points.

